    "(%lld)" : {},
    "1. Right-click the desktop (or click the date in the menu bar to open Notification Center)." : {},
    "2. Choose Edit Widgets." : {},
    "3. Search for Liv Vitals." : {},
    "4. Pick Battery Health, Storage or Device, then click it or drag it onto the desktop." : {},
    "A few maintenance tasks need administrator rights and ask for your password each time. You can add one sudo rule that allows exactly those commands without a password. Nothing is installed unless you choose it, and you can remove the rule at any time in Settings." : {},
