    "Installers" : {},
    "Installers looks for disk images and packages here, three levels deep. On the Desktop it only looks at the files directly on it." : {},
    "It finds caches, logs, build folders and unused apps, and shows you how much space they take. It only reads and measures until you review and confirm a cleanup, and everything it removes can be put back from History." : {},
