    "Lets Liv Vitals move other developers' apps to the Trash." : {},
    "Lets Liv Vitals move other developers' apps to the Trash. macOS does not tell apps whether this is on, so check that Liv Vitals is listed and switched on. If it is not listed yet, click + and add Liv Vitals from Applications." : {},
    "Licenses" : {},
    "Liv Vitals" : {},
    "Liv Vitals adds one rule to sudo. It allows exactly these commands as root for %@, and nothing else:" : {},
    "Liv Vitals needs it to measure and clean caches, logs and app data that macOS protects. Turn on Liv Vitals under Full Disk Access, then come back here. If it still shows as not granted, quit and reopen Liv Vitals." : {},
    "Liv Vitals never removes anything inside these folders, and cleaning scans skip them." : {},
